00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:48.880
<v Man>In the control room, her face shines from the light of the monitor she's hunched over, like in a casino-- a monitor that, minute by minute, tracks the ratings for Intrusos and every other show that's on the air at the same time. I had no idea this was possible. Right now on Intrusos, there's a fight between a former cabaret dancer and a potential candidate for president.
<v Man>在控制室里，她的脸被显示器的光照亮，像是在赌场一样——那台监控器每分钟都在追踪《Intrusos》和同时段其他节目的收视率。我不知道这竟然是可能的。此刻《Intrusos》正在上演一场前歌舞女郎和潜在总统候选人之间的争吵。

00:20:48.880 --> 00:21:00.510
<v Jasmine Garsd>This, like, skyrocketed. The ratings are going up with this segment. It's like four points-- it went from 4.0 to 4.6. This is doing better than the news.
<v Jasmine Garsd>这简直飞涨。收视率随着这个片段而上升。从4.0点涨到了4.6点。这比新闻还好。

