00:59:42.080 --> 01:00:02.000
<v Ira Glass>Our website, thisamericanlife.org, where you can listen to our archive of over 600 episodes for absolutely free. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks as always to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, he was complaining today about how he'd gotten two tickets-- two, both for littering.
<v Ira Glass>我们的网站，thisamericanlife.org，在那里你可以免费收听我们超过600集的档案。 《美国生活》由PRX（公共广播交易所）分发到公共广播电台。一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚先生。你知道，他今天还在抱怨他收到了两张罚单——两张，都是因为乱扔垃圾。

01:00:02.000 --> 01:00:03.790
<v Andrew Collins>Different officer, same candy wrapper.
<v Andrew Collins>不同的警察，同样的糖纸。

01:00:03.790 --> 01:00:07.700
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

01:00:07.700 --> 01:00:12.700
